{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S08、S11、S12等短停留段仍安排了较多感受提示，若观众没及时跟上音乐出现的时点，扫读压力会高于Y。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用【】突出每段心理转折，又通过随音乐逐步出现的感受提示，把人物的想念、委屈、孤独、不甘和逐渐接受串成了有层次的心理过程。尤其是S06—S12，X更准确地呈现了他为什么既想念亲近又不愿回头，以及这种矛盾如何逐渐转化为继续生活的决定。Y整体更容易快速扫读，但部分感受被压缩成并列标签，音乐情绪的细微变化和人物心理的具体质地不如X丰富。</escape>\n}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0c4d94ec-9407-49ce-9466-9bedc428d72b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T022318926078Z", "elapsed_seconds": 116.266, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T02:25:15.196983+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5ad12489b260b53f4b5fc1b0ff4cb1477ec2582f0d58c0ec3bf9a7d53ffd525b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attach